const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"让过去的方差参与今天的方差",en:"Past variance enters today's variance"},body:{zh:"Bollerslev在ARCH的历史误差平方之外加入滞后条件方差，使持续性可以用较少参数表达。这里的条件方差依赖过去信息而变化；无条件方差则概括整个过程。两者并不要求每天相等，也不应被当成同一个数据字段。",en:"Bollerslev adds lagged conditional variance to ARCH's lagged squared innovations, allowing persistence with fewer parameters. Conditional variance changes with past information; unconditional variance summarizes the process. They are not interchangeable daily measurements."},reference:{url:"https://public.econ.duke.edu/~boller/Published_Papers/joe_86.pdf",label:{zh:"1986年期刊版 · §1–2",en:"1986 journal article · §1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"均值模型与方差模型各回答一个问题",en:"Mean and variance models answer different questions"},body:{zh:"论文先定义条件均值为零的创新，再将它放入线性回归的误差项。方差方程描述创新的大小如何变化，并不决定回归均值的正负。即使方差预测准确，也不能据此宣称下一期价格上涨，或认定均值模型没有遗漏信息。",en:"The paper defines zero-conditional-mean innovations and then embeds them in a regression. The variance equation describes their changing magnitude, not the sign of the conditional mean. Accurate variance forecasts do not establish directional predictability or a correctly specified mean."},reference:{url:"https://public.econ.duke.edu/~boller/Published_Papers/joe_86.pdf",label:{zh:"1986年期刊版 · §2 · equations (1)–(3)",en:"1986 journal article · §2 · equations (1)–(3)"}}},{title:{zh:"阶数要对照原文定义",en:"Check which lags each order denotes"},body:{zh:"原文以q表示误差平方的滞后阶数，以p表示条件方差的滞后阶数，并对常数与系数设置非负约束。不同软件可能采用不同参数命名。比较估计结果时，应先写清实际方程，而不是仅凭GARCH括号中的两个数字判断相同。",en:"In the original notation q counts squared-innovation lags and p counts conditional-variance lags, with positivity restrictions on the coefficients. Software naming can differ. Compare the actual equation rather than assuming two identically displayed orders specify the same model."},reference:{url:"https://public.econ.duke.edu/~boller/Published_Papers/joe_86.pdf",label:{zh:"1986年期刊版 · §2 · equation (2)",en:"1986 journal article · §2 · equation (2)"}}},{title:{zh:"有限方差的条件不只是数值稳定",en:"Finite variance is more than numerical stability"},body:{zh:"在文中设定下，两个滞后多项式的系数和小于一对应广义平稳及有限无条件方差。常数除以一减这个系数和，给出无条件方差。优化程序成功结束不能代替这一条件；靠近边界时，长期方差也会对参数变化很敏感。",en:"Under the stated model, the combined lag-coefficient sum below one gives wide-sense stationarity and finite unconditional variance. The latter divides the constant by one minus that sum. Optimizer convergence does not verify this property, especially near the boundary."},reference:{url:"https://public.econ.duke.edu/~boller/Published_Papers/joe_86.pdf",label:{zh:"1986年期刊版 · §2 · Theorem 1",en:"1986 journal article · §2 · Theorem 1"}}},{title:{zh:"简洁递推可以包含很长的历史",en:"A short recursion can retain a long history"},body:{zh:"作者将方差递推改写为历史创新平方的无限滞后形式，也讨论平方过程的ARMA表示。因此，只有一阶条件方差滞后不意味着只记住昨天。它以受约束的权重传递过去冲击，但这种持续性不能自动等同于真正的长记忆过程。",en:"The recursion can be expanded into an infinite distributed lag of squared innovations, with a related ARMA representation for the squared process. One variance lag therefore does not mean only yesterday matters. This constrained persistence is not automatically true long memory."},reference:{url:"https://public.econ.duke.edu/~boller/Published_Papers/joe_86.pdf",label:{zh:"1986年期刊版 · §2 · equations (4)–(7)",en:"1986 journal article · §2 · equations (4)–(7)"}}},{title:{zh:"二阶矩存在，不保证更高阶矩存在",en:"A second moment does not guarantee higher moments"},body:{zh:"GARCH(1,1)的讨论进一步为不同阶矩给出额外条件。一个过程可以有有限方差，却没有研究者希望使用的更高阶矩。读到峰度、极端值或渐近检验时，需要核对相应矩条件，不能仅检查两个系数相加是否小于一。",en:"The GARCH(1,1) discussion places additional restrictions on higher moments. Finite variance alone does not guarantee the moments needed for kurtosis or a particular asymptotic test. Checking only the sum of two coefficients is insufficient for those uses."},reference:{url:"https://public.econ.duke.edu/~boller/Published_Papers/joe_86.pdf",label:{zh:"1986年期刊版 · §3 · Theorem 2",en:"1986 journal article · §3 · Theorem 2"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"GARCH描述条件方差，不预测价格方向。有限方差的平稳条件、严格平稳和高阶矩存在是不同问题，不能用同一个参数和阈值概括。",en:"GARCH models conditional variance, not price direction. Finite-variance stationarity, strict stationarity and existence of higher moments are distinct questions."}};export{e as default};
